<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Granite prices at $7.50/shr.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Granite prices at $7.50/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	    Granite Financial Inc</p>
<p>    Priced At				     $7.50</p>
<p>    Estimated Pricing Range		   $6-$8</p>
<p>    Number of Shares			1,500,000</p>
<p>    Lead Underwriter		Cruttenden Roth</p>
<p>    Description     Provides equipment lease financing</p>
<p>Note: The shares were increased to 1.5 million from 1.0 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
